      "text": [
        "3054 - : وَ كَانَ عَلِيُّ بْنُ اَلْحُسَيْنِ وَ أَبُو جَعْفَرٍ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ يَتَصَدَّقَانِ بِثُلُثٍ عَلَى جِيرَانِهِمْ وَ بِثُلُثٍ عَلَى اَلسُّؤَّالِ وَ بِثُلُثٍ يُمْسِكَانِهِ لِأَهْلِ اَلْبَيْتِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3054 - It is narrated that Imam Ali ibn al-Husayn (as) and Imam Abu Ja'far (Al-Baqir) (as) used to distribute their sacrificial meat in three parts:\nOne-third was given to their neighbors.\nOne-third was given to the needy and beggars.\nOne-third was kept for the members of their household."
        ]
      }
